   "updated_at": "2026-11-17T00:23:37Z",
   "body": "**Operator's go (2026-11-16, relayed by cloud/orch):** the `human/francoisgn` claim is a reservation for the project's agents, so that a third party does not step into this option. It is not the operator's own work: « Si j'ai réservé c'est pour les agents pour éviter une collision avec ezzz ». /release human/francoisgn. Agents of cloud/orch may claim this issue. They work only inside the option's folder and behind its `EXPERIMENTAL` markers (AGENTS §7).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
